  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Patreon-ff424d?logo=patreon&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8GydmUN3xq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Join our Discord-5865F2?logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"加入我们的 Discord\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fquillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Ko--fi-571db5?logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Hiba550/Ore_Vein_Miner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/View on-GitHub-181717?logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 GitHub 上查看\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Hiba550/Ore_Vein_Miner\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/Hiba550/Ore_Vein_Miner?style=social\" alt=\"给此仓库加星\"> </a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49b1e899a9f41e7eeeb877bc53e8d5838998a95b_0.webp\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>矿脉矿工</strong></p>\n<p>当你<strong>潜行</strong>时使用镐破坏一个矿石方块，它会自动挖掘相连的矿石方块。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Xl2GihRU/images/64ad1935bc25e006be50ed8fa4d9697da2639985.gif\" alt=\"矿脉挖掘示例 1\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Xl2GihRU/images/1e1388588ccb36007b8137ce4584200f31626d17.gif\" alt=\"矿脉挖掘示例 2\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>工作原理</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>潜行（蹲下）</strong>并使用<strong>镐</strong>挖掘任何<strong>矿石方块</strong>。<strong>整个相连的矿脉</strong>将被自动挖掘（兼容精准采集）。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>注意事项</h3>\n<p><strong>检测到锋利附魔时会自动禁用矿脉挖掘功能</strong></p>",
